WEBVTT

00:00:00.153 --> 00:00:02.824
How to <b>ring up a sale</b> in MiCaja

00:00:02.877 --> 00:00:07.636
Search the product by name, or scan its barcode

00:00:07.808 --> 00:00:19.201
Every product you tap goes into the cart

00:00:19.427 --> 00:00:22.498
Taking two? Change the quantity here

00:00:22.550 --> 00:00:26.579
Type how much they pay you and MiCaja works out the <b>change</b>

00:00:26.706 --> 00:00:30.896
Check out, and the ticket prints on its own
